  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SPS - Food Safety project in BiH (Sep 2008 - Dec 2011) aims at supporting BiH in adapting to the requirements of the EU and the WTO in the area of food safety and international trade in food and foodstuffs. The project is implemented by the BiH Ministry of Foreign Trade and Economic Relations, MOFTER, with the support of the Swedish agencies SWEDAC and National Food Administration, SLV.</narrative>
